{"id":"37fe734d9e5b5888","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-propositional-code.md","title":"Countably Many Propositional Atoms Proofs and Truth Assignments","display":"df-propositional-code — Countably Many Propositional Atoms Proofs and Truth Assignments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-propositional-code","aliases":["62-df-propositional-code"],"display":"df-propositional-code — Countably Many Propositional Atoms Proofs and Truth Assignments","depends_on":["[[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-derivability]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IV.3.3 and its proof (propositional logic)","source_pages":[140,141],"source_pdf_pages":[158,159]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-propositional-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-propositional-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-propositional-code — Countably Many Propositional Atoms Proofs and Truth Assignments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b467a42733b7257\" href=\"?note=5b467a42733b7257\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion\">62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem IV.3.3 and its proof (propositional logic)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>158</span><span>159</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>数配对与函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>，数码列与有限集合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf a_i,\\mathsf n,\\mathsf j\">\\(\\mathsf a_i,\\mathsf n,\\mathsf j\\)</span> 分别是 Assertion 中定义的原子、否定及蕴涵码构造器；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq N\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq N\\)</span>，f 是数集图，s 是二进制有限列。</p>\n<p>求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(q,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(q,s)\\)</span> 的合法域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{&lt;N}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\ge b(q)\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{&lt;N}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\ge b(q)\\)</span>，递归只在此域上使用。有限列集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}\\)</span> 来自上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAxm}\">\\(\\mathrm{PAxm}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_k\">\\(P_k\\)</span> 以对象数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in N\">\\(k\\in N\\)</span> 为下标；阶段成员及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PF}\\)</span> 成员均由内部有限运行的秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_P\">\\(r_P\\)</span> 定义，不取外部标准有限阶段并集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}\\)</span> 仅对合法命题公式的有限序列码使用。构造函数及联结词缩写都由本文件确定，不与一阶公式数码混用。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hist}_\\rho,\\mathsf{Rec}_\\rho,\\min,\\max\">\\(\\mathsf{Hist}_\\rho,\\mathsf{Rec}_\\rho,\\min,\\max\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^P,\\rho^b,\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}\">\\(\\rho^P,\\rho^b,\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}\\)</span> 在下式逐一给出；前两者无额外参数，第三者的额外数参数是有限赋值码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)\">\\(\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是此前末值的有限表，不是赋值码。辅助运行在非法语法码处返回 0；原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 接口仍只在其原合法域上定义，不把辅助默认值导出为域外取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\">\\(\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)\">\\(k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\)</span> 且各分量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PF}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>总图和有限运行的存在唯一性在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a> 中断言；UC 与推导关系分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。</p>\n<p>阶段恒等式与原有求值递归方程以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\)</span> 为算术背景；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_P,b,\\operatorname{val}\">\\(r_P,b,\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 的定义图由内部运行给出，不由外部标准有限阶段的并集给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf a_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf n(q)\\coloneqq\\langle1,q\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf j(q,r)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\neg q&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf n(q),\\quad(q\\to r)\\coloneqq\\mathsf j(q,r),\\\\\n(q\\land r)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(q\\to\\neg r),\\quad(q\\lor r)\\coloneqq\\neg q\\to r,\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a_0\\to\\mathsf a_0,\\quad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf a_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf n(q)\\coloneqq\\langle1,q\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf j(q,r)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\neg q&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf n(q),\\quad(q\\to r)\\coloneqq\\mathsf j(q,r),\\\\\n(q\\land r)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(q\\to\\neg r),\\quad(q\\lor r)\\coloneqq\\neg q\\to r,\\\\\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a_0\\to\\mathsf a_0,\\quad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0&lt;u(p)]\\lor\n\\exists p,r&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land0&lt;u(r)],\\\\\n\\rho^P(q,u,h)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land h=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists p&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land h=u(p)+1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists p,r&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land0&lt;u(r)\\land h=\\max(u(p),u(r))+1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\neg\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land\\neg\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)\\land h=0)\\Bigr],\\\\\nr_P(q)=h&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^P}(q,h),\\\\\n\\chi_P(q)=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists h\\,[r_P(q)=h\\land((h=0\\land b=0)\\lor(0&lt;h\\land b=1))],\\\\\nP_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:0&lt;r_P(q)\\le k+1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PF}\\coloneqq\\{q:\\chi_P(q)=1\\},\\\\\nP_0&amp;=\\{\\mathsf a_i:i\\in N\\},\\quad\nP_{k+1}=P_k\\cup\\{\\mathsf n(q),\\mathsf j(q,r):q,r\\in P_k\\},\\\\\nq\\in\\mathrm{PF}&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\ q\\in P_k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0&lt;u(p)]\\lor\n\\exists p,r&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land0&lt;u(r)],\\\\\n\\rho^P(q,u,h)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land h=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists p&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land h=u(p)+1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\exists p,r&lt;q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0&lt;u(p)\\land0&lt;u(r)\\land h=\\max(u(p),u(r))+1]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\neg\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land\\neg\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)\\land h=0)\\Bigr],\\\\\nr_P(q)=h&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^P}(q,h),\\\\\n\\chi_P(q)=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists h\\,[r_P(q)=h\\land((h=0\\land b=0)\\lor(0&lt;h\\land b=1))],\\\\\nP_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:0&lt;r_P(q)\\le k+1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PF}\\coloneqq\\{q:\\chi_P(q)=1\\},\\\\\nP_0&amp;=\\{\\mathsf a_i:i\\in N\\},\\quad\nP_{k+1}=P_k\\cup\\{\\mathsf n(q),\\mathsf j(q,r):q,r\\in P_k\\},\\\\\nq\\in\\mathrm{PF}&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\ q\\in P_k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho^b(q,u,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin\\mathrm{PF}\\land z=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=i+1)\n\\lor(\\exists p&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=u(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\lor(\\exists p,r&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(u(p),u(r)))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\nb(q)=z&amp;\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^b}(q,z),\\\\\n\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{&lt;N}\\land b(q)\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s),\\\\\n\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\neg\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land z=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=s(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=1-\\min(1,u(p)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p,r&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(1-\\min(1,u(p)),\\min(1,u(r))))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,z;s),\\\\\nb(\\mathsf a_i)&amp;=i+1,\\quad b(\\mathsf n(q))=b(q),\\quad b(\\mathsf j(q,r))=\\max(b(q),b(r)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf a_i,s)&amp;=s(i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf n(q),s)=1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf j(q,r),s)&amp;=\\max(1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\operatorname{val}(r,s)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho^b(q,u,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin\\mathrm{PF}\\land z=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=i+1)\n\\lor(\\exists p&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=u(p))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\lor(\\exists p,r&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(u(p),u(r)))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\nb(q)=z&amp;\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^b}(q,z),\\\\\n\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{&lt;N}\\land b(q)\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s),\\\\\n\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\neg\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land z=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=s(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=1-\\min(1,u(p)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p,r&lt;q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(1-\\min(1,u(p)),\\min(1,u(r))))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,z;s),\\\\\nb(\\mathsf a_i)&amp;=i+1,\\quad b(\\mathsf n(q))=b(q),\\quad b(\\mathsf j(q,r))=\\max(b(q),b(r)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf a_i,s)&amp;=s(i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf n(q),s)=1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf j(q,r),s)&amp;=\\max(1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\operatorname{val}(r,s)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PAxm}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q\\to(r\\to q),\\ [q\\to(r\\to u)]\\to[(q\\to r)\\to(q\\to u)],\\ (\\neg r\\to\\neg q)\\to(q\\to r):q,r,u\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)&amp;\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\forall k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\bigl[p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\n(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\lor p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PAxm}\\lor\\exists i,j&lt;k\\ p(i)=\\mathsf j(p(j),p(k)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\bigl(\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)\\land\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\ p(i)=q\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PCons}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\ (\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)\\land\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,\\neg q)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PSat}(\\Gamma,f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\Gamma\\ \\operatorname{val}(q,f[b(q)])=1,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PFinSat}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\forall a\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{FinCode}(a)\\land(\\forall q\\ (\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\to q\\in\\Gamma))\\to\n\\exists f\\ \\mathsf{PSat}(\\{q:\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\},f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PAxm}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q\\to(r\\to q),\\ [q\\to(r\\to u)]\\to[(q\\to r)\\to(q\\to u)],\\ (\\neg r\\to\\neg q)\\to(q\\to r):q,r,u\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)&amp;\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\forall k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\bigl[p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\n(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\lor p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PAxm}\\lor\\exists i,j&lt;k\\ p(i)=\\mathsf j(p(j),p(k)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\bigl(\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)\\land\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\ p(i)=q\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PCons}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\ (\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)\\land\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,\\neg q)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PSat}(\\Gamma,f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\Gamma\\ \\operatorname{val}(q,f[b(q)])=1,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PFinSat}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\forall a\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{FinCode}(a)\\land(\\forall q\\ (\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\to q\\in\\Gamma))\\to\n\\exists f\\ \\mathsf{PSat}(\\{q:\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\},f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,0)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,1)&amp;\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,1)&amp;\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k)\\land s(k)\\quad(0&lt;k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\lor s(k)\\quad(0&lt;k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}s(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}s(i)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\quad(k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,0)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,1)&amp;\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,1)&amp;\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k)\\land s(k)\\quad(0&lt;k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\lor s(k)\\quad(0&lt;k&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}s(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}s(i)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\quad(k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^P}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^b}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q,s\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,u;s))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\exists R\\exists B\\exists V\\Bigl(\n\\mathsf{Fun}(R,N,N)\\land\\forall q,h\\,[R(q)=h\\leftrightarrow r_P(q)=h]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(B,\\mathrm{PF},N)\\land\\forall q,z\\,[\\langle q,z\\rangle_N\\in B\\leftrightarrow b(q)=z]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(V,\\{\\langle q,s\\rangle_N:\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\},\\{0,1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q,s,z\\,[\\langle\\langle q,s\\rangle_N,z\\rangle_N\\in V\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^P}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^b}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q,s\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,u;s))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\exists R\\exists B\\exists V\\Bigl(\n\\mathsf{Fun}(R,N,N)\\land\\forall q,h\\,[R(q)=h\\leftrightarrow r_P(q)=h]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(B,\\mathrm{PF},N)\\land\\forall q,z\\,[\\langle q,z\\rangle_N\\in B\\leftrightarrow b(q)=z]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(V,\\{\\langle q,s\\rangle_N:\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\},\\{0,1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall q,s,z\\,[\\langle\\langle q,s\\rangle_N,z\\rangle_N\\in V\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>q→r、¬q 是本文件构造码的缩写，与一阶语法的数码标签不同。PF、b、val 由子码递减解析的内部有限运行给出；每个合法 val 调用要求 s 长度至少 b(q)。∧、∨按否定和蕴涵展开。有限集合量词用 FinCode、Mem，没有第三阶有限子集族。每个有限赋值可补零形成总图 f，故 PFinSat 只要求逐有限集的见证，不暗加一个统一见证列。空 Γ 有任一真值赋值；空证明不能推出公式。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem IV.3.3 and its proof (propositional logic)；纸面页 140, 141；PDF 页 158, 159。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"5b467a42733b7257","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数配对与函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，数码列与有限集合见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]。$\\mathsf a_i,\\mathsf n,\\mathsf j$ 分别是 Assertion 中定义的原子、否定及蕴涵码构造器；$\\Gamma\\subseteq N$，f 是数集图，s 是二进制有限列。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数配对与函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，数码列与有限集合见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]。$\\mathsf a_i,\\mathsf n,\\mathsf j$ 分别是 Assertion 中定义的原子、否定及蕴涵码构造器；$\\Gamma\\subseteq N$，f 是数集图，s 是二进制有限列。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Hist}_\\rho,\\mathsf{Rec}_\\rho,\\min,\\max$ 见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]。$\\rho^P,\\rho^b,\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}$ 在下式逐一给出；前两者无额外参数，第三者的额外数参数是有限赋值码 $s$。$\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)$ 的 $u$ 是此前末值的有限表，不是赋值码。辅助运行在非法语法码处返回 0；原有 $b$ 与 $\\operatorname{val}$ 接口仍只在其原合法域上定义，不把辅助默认值导出为域外取值。$\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)$ 的域为 $s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}$、$k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)$ 且各分量属于 $\\mathrm{PF}$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"总图和有限运行的存在唯一性在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中断言；UC 与推导关系分别见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"总图和有限运行的存在唯一性在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中断言；UC 与推导关系分别见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"总图和有限运行的存在唯一性在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中断言；UC 与推导关系分别见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf a_i,\\mathsf n,\\mathsf j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(q,s)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{<N}\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\ge b(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PAxm}","display":false},{"tex":"P_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PF}","display":false},{"tex":"r_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land},\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Hist}_\\rho,\\mathsf{Rec}_\\rho,\\min,\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^P,\\rho^b,\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"r_P,b,\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf a_i&\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf n(q)\\coloneqq\\langle1,q\\rangle_N,\\quad\n\\mathsf j(q,r)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle q,r\\rangle_N\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\neg q&\\coloneqq\\mathsf n(q),\\quad(q\\to r)\\coloneqq\\mathsf j(q,r),\\\\\n(q\\land r)&\\coloneqq\\neg(q\\to\\neg r),\\quad(q\\lor r)\\coloneqq\\neg q\\to r,\\\\\n\\top&\\coloneqq\\mathsf a_0\\to\\mathsf a_0,\\quad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists p<q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0<u(p)]\\lor\n\\exists p,r<q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0<u(p)\\land0<u(r)],\\\\\n\\rho^P(q,u,h)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land h=1)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists p<q\\,[q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land0<u(p)\\land h=u(p)+1]\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\exists p,r<q\\,[q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land0<u(p)\\land0<u(r)\\land h=\\max(u(p),u(r))+1]\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(\\neg\\mathsf{PLeaf}(q)\\land\\neg\\mathsf{PGood}(q,u)\\land h=0)\\Bigr],\\\\\nr_P(q)=h&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^P}(q,h),\\\\\n\\chi_P(q)=b&\\leftrightarrow\\exists h\\,[r_P(q)=h\\land((h=0\\land b=0)\\lor(0<h\\land b=1))],\\\\\nP_k&\\coloneqq\\{q:0<r_P(q)\\le k+1\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PF}\\coloneqq\\{q:\\chi_P(q)=1\\},\\\\\nP_0&=\\{\\mathsf a_i:i\\in N\\},\\quad\nP_{k+1}=P_k\\cup\\{\\mathsf n(q),\\mathsf j(q,r):q,r\\in P_k\\},\\\\\nq\\in\\mathrm{PF}&\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\ q\\in P_k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho^b(q,u,z)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin\\mathrm{PF}\\land z=0)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\bigl(q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=i+1)\n\\lor(\\exists p<q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=u(p))\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}\\lor(\\exists p,r<q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(u(p),u(r)))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\nb(q)=z&\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^b}(q,z),\\\\\n\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)&\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land s\\in2^{<N}\\land b(q)\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s),\\\\\n\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}(q,u,z;s)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(u)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(u)=q\\land\\Bigl[\n(\\neg\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land z=0)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor\\bigl(\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\bigl[\n(\\exists i\\le q\\ q=\\mathsf a_i\\land z=s(i))\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p<q\\ q=\\mathsf n(p)\\land z=1-\\min(1,u(p)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\lor(\\exists p,r<q\\ q=\\mathsf j(p,r)\\land z=\\max(1-\\min(1,u(p)),\\min(1,u(r))))\\bigr]\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\land\\mathsf{Rec}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,z;s),\\\\\nb(\\mathsf a_i)&=i+1,\\quad b(\\mathsf n(q))=b(q),\\quad b(\\mathsf j(q,r))=\\max(b(q),b(r)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf a_i,s)&=s(i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf n(q),s)=1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(\\mathsf j(q,r),s)&=\\max(1-\\operatorname{val}(q,s),\\operatorname{val}(r,s)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PAxm}&\\coloneqq\\{q\\to(r\\to q),\\ [q\\to(r\\to u)]\\to[(q\\to r)\\to(q\\to u)],\\ (\\neg r\\to\\neg q)\\to(q\\to r):q,r,u\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)&\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}\\land\\forall k<\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\bigl[p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\land\n(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\lor p(k)\\in\\mathrm{PAxm}\\lor\\exists i,j<k\\ p(i)=\\mathsf j(p(j),p(k)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\bigl(\\mathsf{PPrf}(\\Gamma,p)\\land\\exists i<\\operatorname{lh}(p)\\ p(i)=q\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PCons}(\\Gamma)&\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\neg\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{PF}\\ (\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,q)\\land\\mathsf{PPbl}(\\Gamma,\\neg q)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PSat}(\\Gamma,f)&\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,\\{0,1\\})\\land\n\\forall q\\in\\Gamma\\ \\operatorname{val}(q,f[b(q)])=1,\\\\\n\\mathsf{PFinSat}(\\Gamma)&\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{PF}\\land\\forall a\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{FinCode}(a)\\land(\\forall q\\ (\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\to q\\in\\Gamma))\\to\n\\exists f\\ \\mathsf{PSat}(\\{q:\\mathsf{Mem}(a,q)\\},f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,0)&\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,0)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,1)&\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0<\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,1)&\\coloneqq s(0)\\quad(0<\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k+1)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k)\\land s(k)\\quad(0<k<\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k+1)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\lor s(k)\\quad(0<k<\\operatorname{lh}(s)),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i<k}s(i)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\land}(s,k),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i<k}s(i)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\lor}(s,k)\\quad(k\\le\\operatorname{lh}(s)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^P}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^b}(q,u))\\land\n(\\forall q,s\\exists!u\\ \\mathsf{Hist}_{\\rho^{\\mathrm{val}}}(q,u;s))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&\n\\exists R\\exists B\\exists V\\Bigl(\n\\mathsf{Fun}(R,N,N)\\land\\forall q,h\\,[R(q)=h\\leftrightarrow r_P(q)=h]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(B,\\mathrm{PF},N)\\land\\forall q,z\\,[\\langle q,z\\rangle_N\\in B\\leftrightarrow b(q)=z]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(V,\\{\\langle q,s\\rangle_N:\\mathsf{VInput}(q,s)\\},\\{0,1\\})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall q,s,z\\,[\\langle\\langle q,s\\rangle_N,z\\rangle_N\\in V\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(q,s)=z]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":8411,"backlinks":[{"id":"c4410266791957a4","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语言见 [[62-df-countable-language]]，Cons 见 [[62-df-first-order-theory]]，Completion 见 [[62-df-completion]]，Models 见 [[62-df-countable-first-order-model]]，命题逻辑代码见 [[62-df-propositional-code]]，有限数集代码见 [[62-df-finite-sequence]]。$\\mathrm{LL},\\mathrm{GCT},\\mathrm{GComp},\\mathrm{PCT},\\mathrm{PComp}$ 在下式引入为 L₂ 句子缩写，$\\mathsf{FinSat}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是公式缩写。"},{"id":"13650208b279e559","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。 $\\Gamma_\\times=\\{\\mathsf a_0,\\neg\\mathsf a_0\\}$，命题码、有限证明、PCons、PSat、PFinSat 见 [[62-df-propositional-code]]。"},{"id":"662111b1b5e3b00d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$、UC 及算术双类可推导关系 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。 $\\operatorname{BinTree}(T)$ 与 Infinite、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；$\\mathsf a_i,\\mathrm{PF},\\mathsf{PSat},\\mathsf{PFinSat}$ 见 [[62-df-propositional-code]]；函数及有限数码见 [[62-df-coded-function]]、[[62-df-finite-sequence]]。有限合取、析取按数码递增结点次序生成；空合取为 $\\top=(\\mathsf a_0\\to\\mathsf a_0)$，空析取为 $\\bot=\\neg\\top$。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-propositional-code|Countably Many Propositional Atoms Proofs and Truth Assignments]]"},{"id":"c1326cfeaba0f163","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-propositional-code]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-propositional-code]]"}],"outgoing":["5b467a42733b7257","c156c03daff0aff0","b7164631e6f56192","dd5e8930337c8b20","4c6d2d9f1999915f","98c3cbeb95500b53"]}